~*
~*  Local modifications applied to the CHESS 4.9 program library when
~*  the chess49 product is built by chess49.job.
~*
~*  PAGEWT - make the "(PAUSING)" page wait resume on a bare carriage
~*  return under NOS 2. IAF delivers an empty terminal line as an
~*  end-of-record, and leaves that EOR status on INPUT after every
~*  line until a fresh READ is issued. RDLINE in deck CODEDIO used to
~*  hand every EOR to INPEOR, which rereads forever on a terminal, so
~*  READER's "empty line means continue" test never ran. INPEOR also
~*  lives in overlay CHESS20, so calling it during a pause overwrote
~*  the EXPLAIN overlay's text.
~*
*IDENT PAGEWT
*/        TREAT END-OF-RECORD ON A TERMINAL PAGE-WAIT READ AS AN EMPTY
*/        LINE.  NOS 2 IAF DELIVERS A BARE CARRIAGE RETURN AS EOR, SO
*/        THE (PAUSING) PROMPT COULD NEVER BE CONTINUED.  THE FIRST EOR
*/        SEEN AFTER A LINE IS THE STALE STATUS OF THAT LINE AND IS
*/        SKIPPED BY ISSUING A FRESH READ IN PLACE (NOT VIA INPEOR,
*/        WHICH LOADS OVERLAY CHESS20 OVER THE CURRENT ONE); THE NEXT
*/        EOR IS THE USER'S CARRIAGE RETURN.
*DECK READER
*I READER.35
          ENTRY  READERA
          ENTRY  READERF
*DECK CODEDIO
*D CODEDIO.162
          EQ     RDLINE6           RETURN, FLAG STALE EOR
*I CODEDIO.164
 RDLINE4  SA2    =XREADERA         QUESTION ORDINAL
          PL     X2,RDLINE3        IF NOT PAGE WAIT
          SA1    RDLINED
          ZR     X1,RDLINE5        IF EOR IS A REAL EMPTY LINE
          BX6    X6-X6
          SA6    A1                CLEAR STALE EOR FLAG
          READ   INPUT             ISSUE FRESH READ, NO OVERLAY LOAD
          SA4    =XREADERF         INPUT LINE BUFFER POINTER
          EQ     RDLINE1           REREAD LINE
 RDLINE5  SA1    INPUT+1
          RJ     =XDEVTYP          CHECK DEVICE TYPE
          PL     X6,RDLINE3        IF ALLOCATABLE
          SA1    =XREADERF         INPUT LINE BUFFER POINTER
          BX6    X6-X6
          SA6    X1                CLEAR FIRST WORD = EMPTY LINE
 RDLINE6  SX6    B1
          SA6    RDLINED           NEXT EOR WILL BE STALE
          EQ     RDLINE            RETURN
*D CODEDIO.166,167
 RDLINEB  ZR     X1,RDLINE6        IF NO EOR/EOF, FLAG STALE EOR
          EQ     RDLINE4           ELSE CHECK PAGE WAIT
 RDLINED  CON    0                 STALE EOR FLAG
